WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.200
Here is the ask.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.163
Defer the fifty million dollar refresh
pending a network modernization assessment.

3
00:00:06.163 --> 00:00:09.160
Have the sponsor state
whether it is acquisition

4
00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.500
or five-year cost, and itemize the scope.

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.263
Validate the ten assumptions, starting
with circuit cost and endpoint count.

6
00:00:16.263 --> 00:00:20.450
Fund Phase zero, about one point
eight million over six months.

7
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.113
Track the five gates, not a
date, for the last server.

8
00:00:24.113 --> 00:00:26.368
The owner is the sponsor with the CIO,

9
00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:29.600
and the timing is before
refresh money is committed.

10
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.070
The decision guide and the
project plan carry the detail,

11
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.110
and both are linked on this slide.
